  "title": "Shared Firebreak",
  "rules": [
    "Move, spray, clear own non-burning fuel, refill near the shared reservoir, or give water to an adjacent crew.",
    "Each active action costs one labor except clearing costs two. Rest restores two up to eight.",
    "Spray consumes one water. Capacity is four. Shared refills and gifts settle in rotating role order.",
    "Every third transition, burning fuel decreases and surviving fire spreads one cell downwind into remaining fuel. Wind rotates every six ticks.",
    "Clearing permanently removes fuel. Burning assets lose one health per transition. Priority-weighted penalties and extinction rewards create different valuations.",
    "Extinction, all assets lost, or horizon 72 ends the episode. Cells and crew state are local; private priorities remain hidden."
  ],
